  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sem. soc.arb. Karelen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seminar social work Karel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att ge &#xe5;tta l&#xe4;rare p&#xe5; universitetsniv&#xe5; kunskaper, st&#xf6;d och inspiration i arbetet med att organisera en socialarbetar- utbildning. L&#xe4;rarna fr&#xe5;n Pedagogiska Universitetet i Petrzavodsk kommer att delta i seminarier om f&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llningss&#xe4;tt, arbetsmetoder och samarbete mellan sociala institutioner.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to strengthen the newly started training at university level of social workers. During 1998-1999 a group of 8 university teachers from the Pedagogic University in Petrozavodsk will participate in seminars regarding attitudes, workingmethods and cooperation between social institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
